[{"page":1,"text":"NOTICE OF A REGULAR\n\nARCH COMMISSION MEETING\n\nSeptember 24, 2026, at 6:00 PM\nPUBLIC NOTICE is hereby given that the Vineyard ARCH Commission will hold a regularly\nscheduled ARCH Commission meeting on Thursday, September 24, 2026, at 6:00 PM, in the\n\nCity Council Chambers at City Hall, 125 South Main Street, Vineyard, UT.\n\nAGENDA\n\n1.\n\nCALL TO ORDER\n\n2.\n\nINVOCATION AND PLEDGE OF ALLEGIANCE (By Invitation)\n\n3.\n\nWORK SESSION\n\n3.1. Vineyard Days Art Show Follow-Up\n\n3.2. ARCH Project for Fiscal Year '26-27\n\n3.3. Review of ARCH Grant Docs\n\n4.\n\nBUSINESS ITEMS\n\n4.1. Secretary Nomination\n\nSecretary Nomination\n\n5.\n\nSTAFF AND COMMISSION REPORTS\n\n5.1. Events Staff Report\n\n5.2. Parks & Rec Director Staff Report\n\n6.\n\nADJOURNMENT\n\nThis meeting may be held in a way that will allow a board member to participate electronically.\nThe public is invited to participate in all ARCH Commission meetings. In compliance with the\nAmericans with Disabilities Act, individuals needing special accommodations during this meeting\nshould notify the City Offices at least 24 hours prior to the meeting by calling (801) 226-1929.\nThe foregoing notice and agenda were posted on the Utah Public Notice Website and Vineyard Website,\nposted at the Vineyard City Hall, delivered electronically to city staff and each member of the ARCH\n\nCommission.\n\nAGENDA NOTICING COMPLETED ON September 23, 2026.\nCERTIFIED (NOTICED) BY /S/Robin Bond, City Recorder","ocr":false}]